1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:00,656
An engineer

2
00:00:00,656 --> 00:00:01,580
was tasked with

3
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:02,505
building a skyscraper

4
00:00:02,505 --> 00:00:03,429
in an area

5
00:00:03,429 --> 00:00:04,353
frequently hit by

6
00:00:04,353 --> 00:00:04,969
strong winds

7
00:00:04,969 --> 00:00:05,585
and earthquakes.

8
00:00:05,629 --> 00:00:06,539
He started by

9
00:00:06,539 --> 00:00:07,146
connecting massive

10
00:00:07,146 --> 00:00:07,754
steel columns

11
00:00:07,754 --> 00:00:08,361
to form

12
00:00:08,361 --> 00:00:08,968
a structural

13
00:00:08,968 --> 00:00:09,271
framework,

14
00:00:09,271 --> 00:00:09,878
then built

15
00:00:09,878 --> 00:00:10,485
the skyscraper

16
00:00:10,485 --> 00:00:11,093
one floor

17
00:00:11,093 --> 00:00:12,003
at a time.

18
00:00:12,047 --> 00:00:12,670
But once

19
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:13,292
the building

20
00:00:13,292 --> 00:00:13,915
was completed,

21
00:00:13,915 --> 00:00:14,538
powerful winds

22
00:00:14,538 --> 00:00:15,161
caused the

23
00:00:15,161 --> 00:00:15,784
upper floors

24
00:00:15,784 --> 00:00:16,407
to sway

25
00:00:16,407 --> 00:00:17,341
back and forth,

26
00:00:17,341 --> 00:00:17,964
shaking everything

27
00:00:17,964 --> 00:00:18,275
inside.

28
00:00:18,319 --> 00:00:19,268
He immediately added

29
00:00:19,268 --> 00:00:20,218
diagonal steel braces

30
00:00:20,218 --> 00:00:20,852
to make

31
00:00:20,852 --> 00:00:21,485
the structure

32
00:00:21,485 --> 00:00:22,118
more rigid.

33
00:00:22,162 --> 00:00:23,018
The building became

34
00:00:23,018 --> 00:00:23,589
more stable,

35
00:00:23,589 --> 00:00:24,730
but it still swayed

36
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:25,587
enough to make

37
00:00:25,587 --> 00:00:26,157
people inside

38
00:00:26,157 --> 00:00:26,443
uncomfortable.

39
00:00:26,486 --> 00:00:26,976
That's when

40
00:00:26,976 --> 00:00:27,956
he came up with

41
00:00:27,956 --> 00:00:28,690
an unusual solution.

42
00:00:28,734 --> 00:00:29,328
He installed

43
00:00:29,328 --> 00:00:29,923
a massive

44
00:00:29,923 --> 00:00:30,518
steel sphere

45
00:00:30,518 --> 00:00:31,411
near the top

46
00:00:31,411 --> 00:00:32,303
of the skyscraper,

47
00:00:32,303 --> 00:00:33,195
suspended it from

48
00:00:33,195 --> 00:00:33,493
heavy-duty

49
00:00:33,493 --> 00:00:34,087
steel cables,

50
00:00:34,087 --> 00:00:34,980
and connected it

51
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:35,872
to a series

52
00:00:35,872 --> 00:00:36,467
of dampers.

53
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:37,302
When the wind

54
00:00:37,302 --> 00:00:38,095
pushed the building

55
00:00:38,095 --> 00:00:38,887
to the left,

56
00:00:38,887 --> 00:00:39,415
inertia caused

57
00:00:39,415 --> 00:00:39,943
the sphere

58
00:00:39,943 --> 00:00:40,471
to resist

59
00:00:40,471 --> 00:00:40,999
the movement,

60
00:00:40,999 --> 00:00:41,791
making it move

61
00:00:41,791 --> 00:00:42,320
in the

62
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:42,848
opposite direction

63
00:00:42,848 --> 00:00:43,376
relative to

64
00:00:43,376 --> 00:00:43,904
the building.

65
00:00:43,947 --> 00:00:44,886
As the building

66
00:00:44,886 --> 00:00:45,511
changed direction,

67
00:00:45,511 --> 00:00:46,449
the sphere continued

68
00:00:46,449 --> 00:00:47,700
swinging out of sync,

69
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:48,638
generating a force

70
00:00:48,638 --> 00:00:49,264
that counteracted

71
00:00:49,264 --> 00:00:49,889
some of

72
00:00:49,889 --> 00:00:50,828
the building's motion.

73
00:00:50,871 --> 00:00:51,502
The dampers

74
00:00:51,502 --> 00:00:52,449
absorbed the energy

75
00:00:52,449 --> 00:00:53,396
from these oscillations

76
00:00:53,396 --> 00:00:54,343
and dissipated it

77
00:00:54,343 --> 00:00:54,975
as heat.

78
00:00:55,018 --> 00:00:55,945
As a result,

79
00:00:55,945 --> 00:00:56,563
the building's

80
00:00:56,563 --> 00:00:56,872
movements

81
00:00:56,872 --> 00:00:57,799
became less pronounced.

82
00:00:57,842 --> 00:00:58,508
When another

83
00:00:58,508 --> 00:00:59,506
powerful windstorm hit,

84
00:00:59,506 --> 00:01:00,172
the massive

85
00:01:00,172 --> 00:01:01,170
steel sphere began

86
00:01:01,170 --> 00:01:01,835
swinging back

87
00:01:01,835 --> 00:01:02,501
and forth,

88
00:01:02,501 --> 00:01:03,832
while the people inside

89
00:01:03,832 --> 00:01:04,831
could continue working

90
00:01:04,831 --> 00:01:05,496
more comfortably.

91
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:06,363
It turns out

92
00:01:06,363 --> 00:01:07,187
that the secret

93
00:01:07,187 --> 00:01:07,737
to keeping

94
00:01:07,737 --> 00:01:08,560
a skyscraper stable

95
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:09,110
isn't always

96
00:01:09,110 --> 00:01:10,208
making it more rigid...

97
00:01:10,311 --> 00:01:10,969
It's knowing how

98
00:01:10,969 --> 00:01:11,408
to control

99
00:01:11,408 --> 00:01:12,286
the way it moves.
